{"id":"chatcmpl-99ca4a933d90b591","object":"chat.completion","created":1788642351,"model":"qwen38flashnext","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"\n\nUsing the product rule:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(x^3 \\sin x\\right)\n= \\frac{d}{dx}(x^3)\\sin x + x^3\\frac{d}{dx}(\\sin x)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n= 3x^2\\sin x + x^3\\cos x\n\\]\n\nSo the derivative is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{3x^2\\sin x + x^3\\cos x}\n\\]","refusal":null,"annotations":null,"audio":null,"function_call":null,"reasoning":"We need answer derivative of x^3 * sin(x). Straightforward. Need final concise with product rule. Compute d/dx x^3 sin x = 3x^2 sin x + x^3 cos x. Maybe factor x^2(3 sin x + x cos x).\n"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","stop_reason":null,"token_ids":null,"routed_experts":null}],"service_tier":null,"system_fingerprint":"vllm-0.28.1rc1.dev446+g798544433-tp4-ep-72ccc4a5","usage":{"prompt_tokens":64,"total_tokens":238,"completion_tokens":174,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":61}},"prompt_logprobs":null,"prompt_token_ids":null,"prompt_text":null,"kv_transfer_params":null,"ec_transfer_params":null,"metrics":null}